  "The key %s opens MoveAnything! now.": "%s nyní otevírá MoveAnything!.",
  "Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one.": "Příkazy: /move (okno), /move FrameName (přesun), /move pick (výběr), /move hide FrameName (skrýt/zobrazit), /move done (dokončit), /unmove FrameName (obnovit), /move key <key> (klávesa), /movelist (seznam), /movecopy Name (kopírovat), /movedelete Name (smazat).",
